00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:14,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that arm turns virtually
into the equivalent of the swing</font>

141
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of a celebrated sword that
cuts through everything.</font>

142
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what a reckless technique...</font>

143
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not for you to say...</font>

144
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Lee-kun?</font>

145
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's beyond my scope of
comprehension, but...</font>

146
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an awesome technique!</font>

147
00:11:37,170 --> 00:11:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can understand it...</font>

148
00:11:39,590 --> 00:11:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it were me, if I made
a running start at that speed,</font>

149
00:11:42,590 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't make a direct jab attack
on the opponent...</font>

150
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or rather, I couldn't.</font>

151
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For an opponent,</font>

152
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a straight line attack just gives him
an easy chance to launch a counter-blow.</font>

153
00:11:55,560 --> 00:12:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover, I don't have the eyes
to read that counter-blow.</font>

154
00:12:03,450 --> 00:12:06,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I envy you... Sasuke-kun!</font>

155
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:11,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I fought you once, I said...</font>

156
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if one understands visually,</font>

157
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's meaningless unless
one can move physically...</font>

158
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was filled with
a feeling of superiority.</font>

159
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now, you have a body that moves
at the same high speed as mine.</font>

160
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:29,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, you have...</font>

161
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Sharingan!</font>

162
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I caught you!</font>

163
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Squadron.
We are ready any time.</font>

164
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All preparations are complete
on this end too.</font>

165
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger. Proceed with action
at the signal.</font>

166
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it's almost time.</font>

167
00:13:09,890 --> 00:13:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guy who was worrying about
Sasuke until just a moment ago...</font>

168
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is now jealous of him.</font>

169
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

170
00:13:27,610 --> 00:13:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the feeling!</font>

171
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

172
00:13:47,930 --> 00:13:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've gotten stronger...</font>

173
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to become Hokage...</font>

174
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order not to lose to anyone...</font>

175
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

176
00:13:56,350 --> 00:13:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order not to lose to you.</font>

177
00:14:00,190 --> 00:14:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want... to fight you, too.</font>

178
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you are...</font>

179
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:10,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

180
00:14:30,470 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? This warm thing...?</font>

181
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother...? What is...?</font>

182
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blood... my blood is...!</font>

183
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't tell me that...</font>

184
00:15:09,470 --> 00:15:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't tell me that
Gaara is hurt?!</font>

185
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:22,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!</font>

186
00:15:23,690 --> 00:15:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's that thing's arm!</font>

187
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Doing something
careless like that...</font>

188
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has the Perfect Possession happened?</font>

189
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.
He seems to be injured...</font>

190
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This has never happened before.</font>

191
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It gives me the chills
just to remember...</font>

192
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I first saw that thing,
I wasn't able to eat...</font>

193
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, visually it's totally...</font>

194
00:16:46,730 --> 00:16:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is...</font>

195
00:16:48,770 --> 00:16:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this sensation?</font>

196
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's hurt, after all...</font>

197
00:17:31,730 --> 00:17:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shell was broken when
his body was incomplete!</font>

198
00:17:44,450 --> 00:17:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's different! Those aren't the eyes!</font>

199
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that...
that look earlier on?!</font>

200
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

201
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...? I can't see...</font>

202
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi! This must be!</font>

203
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... a Genjutsu!</font>

204
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Release!
— Release!</font>

205
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on...?</font>

206
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

207
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu!
Is Kabuto already moving?</font>

208
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case, it's just about time...</font>

209
00:19:28,430 --> 00:19:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's coming!</font>

210
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we begin?!</font>

211
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the signal!</font>

212
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Start the operation!
— Start the operation!</font>

213
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

214
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

215
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

216
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

217
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

218
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

219
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

220
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

221
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

222
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

223
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

224
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

225
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

226
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

227
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

228
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

229
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

230
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

231
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

232
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

233
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

234
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

235
00:22:46,090 --> 00:22:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It got dark all of a sudden...
it feels so good.</font>

236
00:22:52,430 --> 00:22:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I hear something in the distance.</font>

237
00:22:54,220 --> 00:22:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sakura-chan's voice, Kakashi-sensei's voice...</font>

238
00:22:57,680 --> 00:23:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Scream? I just heard something loud.</font>

239
00:23:00,310 --> 00:23:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I think I do, but...
Sasuke...</font>

240
00:23:02,980 --> 00:23:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I got to watch his match!</font>

241
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But I really don't know
what's going on.</font>

242
00:23:08,780 --> 00:23:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Destruction of Leaf Village Commenced!"</font>

243
00:23:11,950 --> 00:23:13,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What in the world is going on?!</font>

